# Round-7 cleanup (2026-07-01, hardened after senior review): large
# reference PDFs and debug artifacts should NEVER be committed. Keep
# patterns narrow — broad patterns like `Sample*.pdf` and `*thesis*.pdf`
# would silently ignore legitimate PDFs (invoices, resumes, etc.). Use
# the exact filename + the debug-artifacts directory + a single specific
# pattern for the `Sample thesis for testing.pdf` filename family.
debug-artifacts/
Sample thesis for testing.pdf
"Sample thesis for testing.pdf"

